/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Black Soldier Fly \(BSF\), Hermetia illucens, is a tropical insect belonging to the Stratiomyidae family. Native to warm regions, including Kenya, BSFs are renowned for their efficiency in converting organic waste into protein-rich larvae and frass, promoting circular agriculture. Their farming offers benefits in waste management, protein production, and income generation.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
