135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Our model integrates BSFL farming with vermicomposting and greenhouse cultivation. BSFL frass is processed further with red wigglers vermicompost as well as fermentation processes to produce a nutrient-dense organic biofertilizers. We also develop innovative value-added products like Green Tags, embedding tree seeds in frass-infused biodegradable paper.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
